        <description><![CDATA[<div>
    <h2>1.1 (2) (2026-11-20)</h2>
<ul>
<li>🗂️ Add a custom tab bar with drag-to-reorder and ⌘1–⌘9 tab shortcuts.</li>
<li>🧭 Navigate between split panes with ⌘⇧ arrow keys.</li>
<li>🖥️ Support clickable terminal links, Sixel graphics, and bidirectional text.</li>
<li>🐚 Add zsh and bash shell integration for directory tracking and prompt navigation.</li>
<li>📍 Open new tabs and split panes in the current directory.</li>
<li>✨ Add prompt navigation (⌥⌘↑/↓) and clear scrollback (⌃⌘K).</li>
<li>🔐 Pass your environment to shells so SSH agent and PATH are available.</li>
<li>🪟 Preserve fullscreen toolbar behavior and close confirmation.</li>
</ul>
</div>]]></description>
